+         row  `UnknownTypeFlag(byte)`  4  _the entry type flag `code` is not recognised_  该条目按 POSIX 的规定降级为普通文件，绝不会降级为目录
+         row  `TruncatedStream(needed, got)`  5  _the archive stream ended unexpectedly_  不完整的头部、过短的正文，或缺少结尾的零块

