+         row  `DeviceCreationUnsupported(path)`  10  _the special device entry at `path` could not be created on this filesystem_  `extractTo` 遇到了 FIFO 或设备，或 `archive[Tar]` 遇到了 tar 无法存储的后代
+         row  `WriteUnsupported`  11  _TAR archives cannot yet be opened for writing_  带 `Write` 模式的 `open[Tar]`；请用 `create[Tar]` 或通过写出一个 `Tarfile` 来写入
+         row  `AlreadyExists`  12  _an archive already exists at this path_  不带 `CreateFlag.Replace` 的 `create[Tar]`
